    <dashboard name='Metric Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/APCorporateWeeklyKPI_16896683775550/MetricDefinitions?rev=' id='MetricDefinitions' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/APCorporateWeeklyKPI' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_105' value='top' />
          <format attr='wrap' id='dash-text_105' value='off' />
          <format attr='text-orientation' id='dash-text_105' value='0' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1000' maxwidth='1260' minheight='1000' minwidth='1260' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='98666' id='626' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98730' x='635' y='667'>
          <zone fixed-size='115' h='11500' id='627' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98730' x='635' y='667'>
            <zone fixed-size='215' h='11500' id='164' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='17698' x='635' y='667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='24'>    foodpanda</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#b00f53' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11500' id='165' type-v2='text' w='81032' x='18333' y='667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='22'>   Definitions</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='36000' id='105' type-v2='text' w='98730' x='635' y='12167'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>General Definitions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>(1) Corporate, Commercial &amp; Operations Overview each has 2 sections: Section A Overall Business OKRs &amp; Section B Corporate Metrics</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>(2) Dashboard is refreshed every Monday on weekly basis, data is accurate as of latest Sunday of the week</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>(3) MTD Δ % : Month To Date % Change (e.g. 1-6 June vs 1-6 May % change, depending on latest refresh date)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>(4) LW Δ %: Last Week % Change (e.g. 2021-22 vs 2021-21 % change, depending on latest refresh date)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>(5) LM Δ %: Last Month % Change (previous FULL MONTH comparison, e.g. May vs Apr % change, depending on latest refresh date)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>(6) Corporations End Users: # Active users tagged to corporate clients in Corp Admin </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>Corporate Weekly Overview Definitions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Pandapro Signups: # Corporate pandapro signups by week / month (Inclusive of new signups and renewals: a corporate user can sign up more than once if previous subscription has ended)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Weekly - Users (From Active Corporations) - With Or Without Orders: # corporate end users in that week with &apos;Active&apos; status in Corp Admin (must be from companies with &apos;Active&apos; status in Corp Admin)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Weekly - Active Users With Orders (Valid Orders): # Users (From Active Corporations) who placed at least 1 valid corporate order in that week</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='15'>Other Notes</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>TW Voucher Shop GMV &amp; Order count are offline B2B sales. They have been included in the Voucher Shop tables for convenience &amp; accuracy of tracking total corporate GMV and orders.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
